Subject: [PATCH] testsuite: serialize T7060 dump checks

T7060a, T7060b, and T7060c each remove the same dump directory and
compile T7060.hs into the same object and interface files. Running
these prerequisites concurrently races both dump checks and object
file renames. Serialize only the prerequisites of T7060 so all three
checks remain enabled with parallel make.

diff --git a/testsuite/tests/driver/Makefile b/testsuite/tests/driver/Makefile
index dc45e84..30e3bc0 100644
--- a/testsuite/tests/driver/Makefile
+++ b/testsuite/tests/driver/Makefile
@@ -540,6 +540,7 @@ T7060c:
 	"$(TEST_HC)" $(TEST_HC_OPTS) -O -c T7060.hs -dumpdir T7060dump -ddump-to-file -ddump-rule-rewrites
 	[ -f T7060dump/T7060.dump-rule-rewrites ]
 
+.NOTPARALLEL: T7060
 .PHONY: T7060
 T7060: T7060a T7060b T7060c
 
